]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Johnston County came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 37 of 75 years from 1951 to 2025. In 2025 the middle ran 183% of normal in April to May and 57% of normal in January to February 2025. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, and grid 16934 got 45% of normal that year.</p>"}
